#var, use command >Rest Client: Switch Environment in search bar of vs code
@id =1

###

### Get all classrooms
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/classrooms HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get classroom by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/classrooms/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Create a new classroom
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/classrooms HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aula 101",
  "code": "A101",
  "description": "Aula principal del edificio A",
  "location": "Edificio A, Primer Piso",
  "capacity": 40,
  "type": "TEORIA",
  "status": "AVAILABLE",
  "features": ["PROYECTOR", "COMPUTADOR", "WIFI"]
}

###

### Update an existing classroom
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/classrooms/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aula 101 - Actualizada",
  "description": "Aula principal renovada del edificio A",
  "capacity": 45,
  "status": "MAINTENANCE",
  "features": ["PROYECTOR", "COMPUTADOR", "WIFI", "AUDIO"]
}

###

### Delete a classroom
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/classrooms/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
